RISK_ROUTE = ("SAME-DAY RISK ROUTE — ask directly and plainly about self-harm and suicidal thinking; do not end the "
              "session and leave the young person alone with it; inform your supervisor the same day; inform parents "
              "unless doing so would increase risk; contact the GP or CAMHS; emergency services or the Emergency "
              "Department if risk is imminent. Record what you asked, what was said and what you did. Supervision "
              "follows action; it never replaces it.")

CP_ROUTE = ("CHILD PROTECTION — if anything suggests abuse or neglect: listen, do not question or investigate, do not "
            "promise secrecy, write down the child's exact words with date and time. Report to Tusla as soon as "
            "practicable (Children First Act 2015; you are a mandated person) AND inform the school's DLP. Telling the "
            "DLP does NOT discharge your own duty. Supervision follows the action the same day; it never replaces it.")

